N5008 [class.default.ctor]/4, [temp.inst]/3: the front end defines zone's
implicit default constructor although it is not odr-used, which instantiates
holder<int>::holder() and then deleter<impl>::operator() for the incomplete
impl: its body is dropped.  Reduced from libstdc++ 13 <chrono>
(cpp11_libstdcxx_header_drops/test_chrono.desc).  g++ 13 and clang++ 18
accept this program, and it fails only its WRONG assertion.
